### Event Gateway API - Negative Scenario Requests
### Run with the IntelliJ HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@existingEventId = 9b63f0d4-0f49-4f85-9447-fd45a0c5b3c2
@accountId = acct-http-123

### Validation error - missing required fields and non-positive amount
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": null,
  "accountId": "",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 0,
  "currency": "usd",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "http-client"
  }
}

### Malformed request - invalid enum value
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "89d53646-0ebd-48d4-a337-96fa610d8e93",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "TRANSFER",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {}
}

### Malformed request - eventTimestamp must use UTC timezone
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "7fe118d2-1958-4238-8647-a52c55b946c8",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T09:02:11-05:00",
  "metadata": {}
}

### Malformed request - invalid JSON body
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "22480c4f-8a7c-4b82-b1d4-a2ef55bcb2e2",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {
}

### Conflict - reuse an existing event id with a different amount
### Run the happy-path submit request for the existing event id before this request.
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{existingEventId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 999.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "http-client",
    "batchId": "B-9042"
  }
}

### Not found - unknown event id
GET {{host}}/events/5ab0b00c-826f-42c5-bd9f-bb7ee8a690ac

### Validation error - missing account query parameter
GET {{host}}/events

### Validation error - blank account query parameter
GET {{host}}/events?account=
